t\":false,\"TicketUrl\":null}',1,'2023-10-05 04:51:56','2023-10-05 04:51:59'),(48,'VANFEST USA 2023','cityspark','12548115',152,'Vanfest started amongst the picturesque red-rocks backdrop of southern Utah, and we\'re back for 2023! Join us at the Washington County Legacy Park in Hurricane, UT for three days of vans, music, and community.\n\nVanFest 2023 will be headlined by Alt Bloom, an alternative soul artist from Montana. Currently living in a converted school bus that doubles as his home and studio, AltBloom\'s music reflects his unconventional lifestyle, blending elements of soul, rock, and R&B with his own unique palette. Check him out on Spotify!\n\nWe\'ll have five local food trucks, standup comedy with the legendary Leroy Firwood, van games, potlucks, open mics, fitness classes, group hikes, and live music featuring Cross-Eyed Possum, James Gilmore, Tyler Dhone, Jason Walsmith, and South for Winter.Don\'t miss out - grab your tickets now!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-10-29 00:00:00','1970-01-01 00:00:00','{\"field1\":\"\",\"PId\":12548115,\"Name\":\"VANFEST USA 2023\",\"Description\":\"Vanfest started amongst the picturesque red-rocks backdrop of southern Utah, and we\'re back for 2023! Join us at the Washington County Legacy Park in Hurricane, UT for three days of vans, music, and community.\\n\\nVanFest 2023 will be headlined by\\u00a0**Alt Bloom**, an alternative soul artist from Montana. Currently living in a converted school bus that doubles as his home and studio, AltBloom\'s music reflects his unconventional lifestyle, blending elements of soul, rock, and R&B with his own unique palette. Check him out on\\u00a0**Spotify**!\\n\\nWe\'ll have five local food trucks, standup comedy with the legendary\\u00a0**Leroy Firwood**, van games, potlucks, open mics, fitness classes, group hikes, and live music featuring\\u00a0**Cross-Eyed Possum**,\\u00a0**James Gilmore**,\\u00a0**Tyler Dhone**,\\u00a0**Jason Walsmith**, and\\u00a0**South for Winter**.Do