:\"#FE5000\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"\",\"information_block\":\"<p><strong>Thanksgiving: Thursday, November 23, 2023<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.visitsouthernutah.com\\/media\\/uploads\\/images\\/turkey%20trot%202019.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" \\/><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Start your Thanksgiving morning with the K-Town Turkey Trot 5K fun run. Meet us out at Jackson Flat Reservoir 2 miles South of Kanab. The Turkey Trot will take place on the\\u00a0Sherry Belle Trail that encompasses 3 miles of beautiful Jackson Flat Reservoir.<\\/p>\\n<p>The race begins at 8:30am.\\u00a0 Day of registration is at 7:30am. Dress up in your favorite Thanksgiving flare! What better way to start your Thanksgiving than with a 5K fun run before eating your delicious Thanksgiving feast!?!<\\/p>\\n<p>Early registration pricing:<br \\/>\\n$5\\/individual<br \\/>\\n$20\\/family*<\\/p>\\n<p>Register before November 23rd to take advantage of early pricing<\\/p>\\n<p>Price increases on November 23rd to the following:<br \\/>\\n$10\\/individual<br \\/>\\n$40\\/family*<\\/p>\\n<p>*Family Pricing is for immediate family members only and is limited to 6 per group. (mom, dad and children, etc&#8230;, or family members living under the same roof) Extended family members are not included in the Family Pricing.<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"\",\"gallery\":[{\"ID\":2647,\"id\":2647,\"title\":\"Turkey-Trot-Run\",\"filename\":\"Turkey-Trot-Run.jpg\",\"filesize\":367176,\"url\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/11\\/Turkey-Trot-Run.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/kanab-holiday-kickoff\\/turkey-trot-run\\/\",\"alt\":\"\",\"author\":\"8\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"turkey-trot-run\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploaded_to\":1835,\"date\":\"2019-11-27 21:14:53\",\"modified\":\"2019-12-03 16:43:44\",\"menu_order\":0,\"mime_type\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype