/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Grand Circle Trailfest\"}]}]}},\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"Grand Circle Trailfest\",\"location_name\":\"Jacob Hamblin Park\",\"address\":\"566 N 100 E, Kanab, UT 84741\",\"contact_number\":\"\",\"start_datetime\":\"October 4, 2023 4:00 pm\",\"multi_day_event\":true,\"category\":{\"term_id\":11,\"name\":\"Parks &amp; Outdoor\",\"slug\":\"parks-outdoor\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":11,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#00FE3B\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.vacationraces.com\\/trailfest\\/kanab\\/\",\"information_block\":\"<div class=\\\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\\\">\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"nc684nl6\\\">Trailfest is a 3-day\\/4-night trail running festival in the heart of North America&#8217;s most scenic national parks: Bryce Canyon, Zion, &amp; Horseshoe Bend.<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h5>Whether you&#8217;re a hardcore ultramarathon runner or just getting into trail running, or maybe you&#8217;re just a supportive spouse (bring the whole family) or friend who doesn&#8217;t run, the Grand Circle Trailfest has something for you!<\\/h5>\\n<p>Each day, we&#8217;ll run a segment of trail highlighting the natural landscape unique to that particular area. Each race is timed and you&#8217;ll receive a cumulative time at the end of the festival on Saturday. Top finishers for each course will be crowned at Trailfest Headquarters in Kanab, Utah at the end of each day.<\\/p>\\n<p>Registration includes full participation in all three races, full Festival access, an on-site camping spot with a tent (yes, you&#8217;re welcome to bring your own tent if you prefer), and meal tickets for breakfast and dinner Thurs\\u2013Sat. (Additional meal tickets can be purchased on-site.) Festival activities are free for your non-running family and friends.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Basic Itinerary<\\/h4>\\n<p><strong>Wednesday (Oct. 4)<\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Check-in begins at noon<br \\/>\\n<strong>Thursday (Oct. 5)<\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Bryce Canyon race<br \\/>\\n<strong>Friday (Oct. 6)<\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Zion race<br \\/>\\n<strong>Saturday (Oct. 7)<\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Horseshoe Bend race<br \\/>\\n<strong>Sunday (Oct. 8)<\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Check-out by noon<\\/p>\\n<p>Follow us on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/thetrailfest\\\">Facebook<\\/a> or visit <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.vacationraces.com\\/trailfest\\/kanab\\/\\\">Grand Circle Trailfest<\\/a> to learn more or sign up.<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"\",\"gallery\":[{\"ID\":3112,\"id\":3112,\"title\":\"Trailfest-1-1\",\"filename\":\"Trailfest-1-1.jpg\",\"filesize\":108192,\"url\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/grand-circle-trailfest\\/trailfest-1-1\\/\",\"alt\":\"\",\"author\":\"8\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"trailfest-1-1\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploaded_to\":1757,\"date\":\"2019-12-05 00:36:33\",\"modified\":\"2019-12-05 00:36:33\",\"menu_order\":0,\"mime_type\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype\":\"jpeg\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-includes\\/images\\/media\\/default.png\",\"width\":960,\"height\":640,\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-150x150.jpg\",\"thumbnail-width\":150,\"thumbnail-height\":150,\"medium\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-300x200.jpg\",\"medium-width\":300,\"medium-height\":200,\"medium_large\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-768x512.jpg\",\"medium_large-width\":768,\"medium_large-height\":512,\"large\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1.jpg\",\"large-width\":960,\"large-height\":640,\"1536x1536\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-